{
  "_readme": [
    "Versioned characterization of every controller-dispatch source in cowork,",
    "as it behaves TODAY (M0-B baseline). Each entry's `record` is compared",
    "against a record produced by EXECUTING the source in",
    "scripts/test_dispatch_contract_characterization.py — it is not a static",
    "inventory and it is not derived from source text. When M0-C extracts the",
    "DispatchContract gateway/reducer, any divergence here is a behavior change",
    "that must be justified, not silently absorbed.",
    "`policy_block` names what the source does when cowork_policy forbids the",
    "requested controller. Note the three different answers: that divergence IS",
    "the missing gateway."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "base_commit": "aa1ebb6f5d41e0396ed8cb7cc9b5bc9edb82db31",
  "sources": {
    "fresh": {
